.Patch Names


[Roland RD-300 Piano]
0 =1 Piano
1 =2 Piano
2 =3 Piano
3 =HarpsiChord
4 =Clavi
5 =VibraPhone
6 =1 E Piano
7 =2 E Piano
8 =1 Piano  /chorus
9 =2 Piano  /chorus
10=3 Piano  /chorus
11=HarpsiChord  /chorus
12=Clavi  /chorus
13=VibraPhone  /chorus
14=1 E Piano  /chorus
15=2 E Piano  /chorus
16=1 Piano  /tremolo
17=2 Piano  /tremolo
18=3 Piano  /tremolo
19=HarpsiChord  /tremolo
20=Clavi  /tremolo
21=VibraPhone  /tremolo
22=1 E Piano  /tremolo
23=2 E Piano  /tremolo
24=1 Piano  /chorus + tremolo
25=2 Piano  /chorus + tremolo
26=3 Piano  /chorus + tremolo
27=HarpsiChord  /chorus + tremolo
28=Clavi  /chorus + tremolo
29=VibraPhone  /chorus + tremolo
30=1 E Piano  /chorus + tremolo
31=2 E Piano  /chorus +tremolo

